g?format=png\",\"imageAlt\":\"Chasing Unicorns book cover\",\"title\":\"A New Book: Chasing Unicorns\",\"body\":\"Drawing on 20+ years across 5,000+ Techstars startups, \\\"Chasing Unicorns: The Techstars Playbook for Building Billion-Dollar Startups\\\" reveals PRIDE, the five-stage framework behind 13 Techstars unicorns, for building enduring companies in the right order.\",\"ctaLabel\":\"Learn more\",\"ctaHref\":\"https://www.amazon.com/Chasing-Unicorns-Techstars-Playbook-Billion-Dollar-ebook/dp/B0H3QSMMK7?ref_=ast_author_mpb\",\"flipLayout\":false}],\"blockType\":\"featureRows\",\"headingFlair\":{\"showUnderscore\":false,\"glow\":true}}]\n33:[\"$\",\"$L3d\",\"6a29eadaa160e700198597ee\",{\"ctx\":\"$5:0:props:ctx\",\"id\":\"6a29eadaa160e700198597ee\",\"isHidden\":false,\"bgColor\":\"black\",\"cardColor\":\"auto\",\"sourceField\":null,\"blockName\":\"Testimonials\",\"blockType\":\"testimonialCarousel\",\"testimonials\":[{\"id\":3,\"_order\":\"a2\",\"quote\":\"The community at Techstars made me feel very okay with saying: I'm a dancer, I'm a woman, and I'm going to go and build a massive company.\",\"founder\":\"Payal Kadakia\",\"title\":\"Founder\",\"company\":\"ClassPass\",\"vertical\":\"Consumer health\",\"imageAsset\":{\"id\":496,\"title\":\"Payal Kadakia, ClassPass\",\"alt\":\"Payal Kadakia, ClassPass\",\"brandfolderRef\":\"{\\\"attachmentId\\\":\\\"q1qtuo-fsrxhk-fsf13d\\\",\\\"cdnUrl\\\":\\\"https://cdn.bfldr.com/70W92OEX/at/q1qtuo-fsrxhk-fsf13d/1110x740-Payal-Profile.png\\\",\\\"thumbnailUrl\\\":\\\"https://thumbs.bfldr.com/at/q1qtuo-fsrxhk-fsf13d/v/7650066?expiry=1783443600\u0026fit=bounds\u0026height=162\u0026sig=ZGQ5MmJkMDc2ZDA3NDdkMjNkYWYxYmZkM2RkMmU2Mjk2YzAzYzdmMw%3D%3D\u0026width=262\\\",\\\"filename\\\":\\\"1110x740-Payal-Profile.png\\\",\\\"mimeType\\\":\\\"image/png\\\",\\\"width\\\":1110,\\\"height\\\":740}\",\"attachmentId\":\"q1qtuo-fsrxhk-fsf13d\",\"kind\":\"image\",\"cdnUrl\":\"https://cdn.bfldr.com/70W92OEX/at/q1qtuo-fsrxhk-fsf13d/1110x740-Payal-Profile.png\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://thumbs.bfldr.com/at/q1qtuo-fsrxhk-fsf13d/v/7650066?expiry=1783443600\u0026fit=bounds\u0026height=162\u0026sig=ZGQ5MmJkMDc2ZDA3NDdkMjNkYWYxYmZkM2RkMmU2Mjk2YzAzYzdmMw%3D%3D\u0026width=262\",\"mimeType\":\"image/png\",\"width\":1110,\"height\":740,\"updatedAt\":\"2026-07-06T19:18:27.655Z\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-06-30T16:27:01.638Z\"},\"imageUrl\":\"https://cdn.bfldr.com/CBWQP80B/at/tw5c6n2f53n6xf5c5xn4wss/1110x740-Payal-Profile.png?format=png\",\"imageAlt\":\"Payal Kadakia\",\"storyUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hGboga175N0\",\"storyLabel\":\"Watch Payal's story\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-07-17T19:18:26.343Z\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-05-06T21:25:10.693Z\"},{\"id\":100,\"_order\":\"ad\",\"quote\":\"Techstars was a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity that helped Owlet connect some very important dots and set the stage to become who we are now. We built incredible connections and relationships – which we still have today.\",\"founder\":\"Kurt Workman\",\"title\":\"Co-Founder\",\"company\":\"Owlet\",\"vertical\":\"Health\",\"imageAsset\":{\"id\":463,\"title\":\"Kurt Workman, Co-Founder of Owlet\",\"alt\":\"Kurt Workman, Co-Founder of Owlet\",\"brandfolderRef\":\"{\\\"attachmentId\\\":\\\"mccsxbpb3r87hpqvcj8w77\\\",\\\"cdnUrl\\\":\\\"https://cdn.bfldr.com/70W92OEX/at/mccsxbpb3r87hpqvcj8w77/1110x740Kurt-Workman-Owlet.png\\\",\\\"thumbnailUrl\\\":\\\"https://thumbs.bfldr.com/at/mccsxbpb3r87hpqvcj8w77/v/1362628355?expiry=1783440000\u0026fit=bounds\u0026height=162\u0026sig=NTdiMDdiNWMwODRmMWUzM2UyZTMxODhmZGYxYTAyNzE5ZmZmNTVhYw%3D%3D\u0026width=262\\\",\\\"filename\\\":\\\"1110x740Kurt-Workman-Owlet.png\\\",\\\"mimeType\\\":\\\"image/png\\\",\\\"width\\\":1110,\\\"height\\\":740}\",\"attachmentId\":\"mccsxbpb3r87hpqvcj8w77\",\"kind\":\"image\",\"cdnUrl\":\"https://cdn.bfldr.com/70W92OEX/at/mccsxbpb3r87hpqvcj8w77/1110x740Kurt-Workman-Owlet.png\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://thumbs.bfldr.com/at/mccsxbpb3r87hpqvcj8w77/v/1362628355?expiry=1783440000\u0026fit=bounds\u0026height=162\u0026sig=NTdiMDdiNWMwODRmMWUzM2UyZTMxODhmZGYxYTAyNzE5ZmZmNTVhYw%3D%3D\u0026width=262\",\"mimeType\":\"image/png\",\"width\":1110,\"height\":740,\"updatedAt\":\"2026-06-30T15:56:56.721Z\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-06-29T22:53:56.786Z\"},\"imageUrl\":\"https://cdn.bfldr.com/CBWQP80B/at/s6x38kkrmbg79jgk2qpchs4s/1110x740Kurt-Workman-Owlet.png?format=png\",\"imageAlt\":\"Kurt Workman, Co-Founder of Owlet\",\"storyUrl\":\"https://www.techstars.com/blog/program-news/kurt-workman-cofounder-and-ceo-at-owlet-ipo\",\"storyLabel\":null,\"updatedAt\":\"2026-06-30T15:57:57.617Z\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-06-29T22:54:15.718Z\"},{\"id\":1,\"_order\":\"a0\",\"quote\":\"I would say to anyone who is thinking about Techstars, the power of the network can't be understated. It's by far the one single thing that stands out across all accelerators. The ability to really connect with people who make a big difference. By the end of the program, you're Techstars for life.\",\"founder\":\"Constantine Tsang\",\"title\":\"Co-Founder \u0026 CTO\",\"company\":\"Uncanny\",\"vertical\":\"AI Infrastructure\",\"imageAsset\":{\"id\":331,\"title\":\"Testimonial - Constantine Tsang\",\"alt\":\"Constantine Tsang\",\"brandfolderRef\":\"{\\\"attachmentId\\\":\\\"5ntsm6x79q8fb9fphw2h3q3w\\\",\\\"cdnUrl\\\":\\\"https://cdn.bfldr.com/70W92OEX/as/b8vhjkchbqfpwkc784wh/constantine_tsang_Uncanny\\\",\\\"thumbnailUrl\\\":\\\"https://thumbs.bfldr.com/at/5ntsm6x79q8fb9fphw2h3q3w/v/1364533910?expiry=1783972800\u0026fit=bounds\u0026height=162\u0026sig=M2IyY2UyMmM5MzE1Y2FmNjhhMGZmNjZkYmIxMzA1MGFhZjA3YmExNg%3D%3D\u0026width=262\\\",\\\"filename\\\":\\\"constantine tsang Uncanny.jpeg\\\",\\\"mimeType\\\":\\\"image/jpeg\\\",\\\"width\\\":1110,\\\"height\\\":740}\",\"attachmentId\":\"5ntsm6x79q8fb9fphw2h3q3w\",\"kind\":\"image\",\"cdnUrl\":\"https://cdn.bfldr.com/70W92OEX/as/b8vhjkchbqfpwkc784wh/constantine_tsang_Uncanny\",\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https://thumbs.bfldr.com/at/5ntsm6x79q8fb9fphw2h3q3w/v/1364533910?expiry=1783972800\u0026fit=bounds\u0026height=162\u0026sig=M2IyY2UyMmM5MzE1Y2FmNjhhMGZmNjZkYmIxMzA1MGFhZjA3YmExNg%3D%3D\u0026width=262\",\"mimeType\":\"image/jpeg\",\"width\":1110,\"height\":740,\"updatedAt\":\"2026-07-06T19:14:14.099Z\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-06-26T20:23:15.190Z\"},\"imageUrl\":\"https://cdn.bfldr.com/CBWQP80B/at/bqsv2rbt27j9qj3hswwrgmgj/constantine_tsang_Uncanny.jpeg?format=jpeg\",\"imageAlt\":null,\"storyUrl\":null,\"storyLabel\":null,\"updatedAt\":\"2026-07-06T19:15:33.991Z\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-05-06T21:25:10.665Z\"}]}]\n"])</script></body></html>